==Battleground==
*1 [[White Wind]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[White Wind]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Log]] spawns as the boss after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[White Wind]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**5 [[Log]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
**3 [[Log]]s spawn after 2.67 seconds<sup>80f</sup>, delay 4~12 seconds<sup>120f~360f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Log]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

